BUG (mine) IN PANEL (d), caught by Ananto asking "is the X axis alright here?":
  CDF was y = i/n over i in 0..n-1. That starts at 0.0 -- claiming NO tool
  reaches the minimum value when one does -- and ends at (n-1)/n, so the curve
  never reached 1.0 (it visibly stopped at ~0.97). Correct is (i+1)/n.
  He asked about X; the X axis was merely a bad choice (linear 0-2000 with 60%
  of tools under 250 squashes the bulk into the left eighth) and the Y axis was
  actually WRONG. Fixed both: (i+1)/n, log x, xlim from the data not 0.

