  almost no tool lands: 53% sit at 72-170, the rest at 700-3400. Panel (c)
  splits the same way -- excel-reader-mcp and mcp-appium-gestures low,
  locallama-mcp and mcpFirebird high. Two regimes, not a spread of target
  complexity. HYPOTHESIS ONLY (how much server code one tool call reaches);
