2026-09-15  ITEM 89 RESOLVED (uml silent exit) + two harness fixes
================================================================
FALSE ALARM FIRST: a uml re-run showed every LLM call "Error code: 404".
  Not the key (direct probe: /v1/models 200, gpt-4.1 completion 200) and
  not the new env scrub: the httpx line showed the URL was
  https://api.openai.com/v1%20TOFU_LLM_MODEL=gpt-4.1%20... -- my ad-hoc
  re-run used `env $LLM_ENV` in ZSH, which does not word-split, so env got
  ONE argument and the whole string became TOFU_LLM_BASE_URL. The bash
  script was fine. Script hardened anyway: LLM_ENV is now an array
  expanded "${LLM_ENV[@]}". Lesson: never `env $STRING` in zsh.
SCRUB ORDER VERIFIED in the real fuzz path (run(): _start_runner BEFORE
  _initialize_tool_fuzzing): "[secrets] scrubbed ['OPENAI_API_KEY']" then
  LLM_SELECTION_OK -- the langchain client constructed in LLMHandler.__init__
  holds the key; nothing re-reads it from env. No regression.
ROOT CAUSE of uml's silent death (rc=1 after the seed corpus, no INITED, no
  message, no final EXEC_SUMMARY): uml launches as `python server.py`, a
  30-line entry file; the code lives in mcp_core/. predict_module_name() gave
  "server", so atheris instrumented only that; the include list had NO
  'mcp_core' (checked in the log: 'mcp_core' 0, 'server' 1). libFuzzer saw
  zero coverage features after the seeds and called C exit(1) ("no
  interesting inputs") -- and that message was LOST: engine.
  _fuzz_with_interception dup2's stderr into a pipe read by a daemon thread,
  and a C exit() kills the process before Python's except SystemExit /
  finally / the reader thread run. The log ends with the last seed's line.
  run_eval then saw EXEC_SUMMARY n_exec=1 n_success=0 -> executable=no ->
  an exclusion the target never earned. Instrument bug in two layers.
FIX 1: PythonRunner.predict_instrument_packages() = predicted module top-level
  + every package dir (has __init__.py) and .py module under cwd and cwd/src,
  minus .venv/venv/node_modules/tests/test/docs/examples/build/dist. fuzzer.
  _start_runner adds them and LOGS "target packages added to the atheris
  include set: [...]". Test: test_predict_instrument_packages_covers_thin_
  entry_scripts.
FIX 2: run_eval.parse_log: "seed corpus:" present but no " INITED " ->
  rec.libfuzzer_exited_before_inited=True, executable="unknown" (NOT "no"),
  note_instrument=... Verified on the real logs: broken uml run -> unknown/
  before_inited=True; fixed uml run and text-editor -> yes. 13 parse tests OK.
RESULT uml list_diagram_types, 30s, include set ['app','mcp_core','server',
  'tools'] (eval/sandbox/runs/smoke86/antoinebou12__uml-mcp__list_diagram_
  types.fuzz30c.log): rc=0, EXEC_SUMMARY n_exec=14336 n_success=1532
